Thursday-Saturday only\n \n \n\n \nFree Yard Waste Days Thursday-Saturday only\n Boone, IA\n \n\n November 5, 2026 to November 7, 2026 \n\n \n Posted by: Landfill & Recycling Services \n\n \n \n \n\n \n\n Saturday\n\n November 7\n \n \n\n Household Hazardous Waste collection\n 8:00 am\n \n \n\n \nHousehold Hazardous Waste collection\n Boone, IA\n \n\n November 7, 2026 \n 8:00 am · 10:00am \n\nLast Collection event of the season! Posted by: Landfill & Recycling Services \n\n \n \n \n \n\n View the Full Calendar\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \nWelcome to Boone County, Iowa \n \n\nBoone County was established in 1846. It's home to 11 communities and over 26,000 residents. The County is administered by a three-member Board of Supervisors who are elected for four-year terms. Other elected officials include the Attorney, Auditor, Recorder, Sheriff, and Treasurer. \n \n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nDid You Know\n \nSign up to receive notifications when board meetings and agendas are posted, job openings are announced, and more.\n Customize Your Notifications\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nMission Statement\n \nThe mission of Boone County is to be accountable to its citizens in providing innovative and high-quality\ngovernment services in an economical, fair, professional, and courteous manner to enhance and protect the\nhealth, welfare, and safety of those who live and work in Boone County.\n\n\n\n \nBoone County, Iowa\n\n 201 State St.\n\nBoone, IA 50036\n\n Contact Us\n \n\n \nCourthouse Hours\n\n Monday - Friday\n\n 8:00 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\n\n Closed Holidays\n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n©2026 Boone County, Iowa\n \npowered by \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \nUpcoming Holiday Closure Schedule\n \n \nVeteran’s Day (November 11, 2026)\n \nThanksgiving Day (November 26, 2026)\n \nBlack Friday (November 27, 2026)\n \nChristmas Eve Afternoon (December 24, 2026)\n \nChristmas Day (December 25, 2026)\n \n\n\n\n"
